   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>このような者どもに、\n人類の未来を託すことはできません。<ab(700)>",
   "en": "<sp(20)>We cannot entrust humanity's future\nto people such as them.<ab(700)>",
   "notes": "Rainen broadcast continuation."
